index ab5dd83..6e53668 100644
--- a/docs/CLI.md
+++ b/docs/CLI.md
@@ -228,6 +228,27 @@ gufo serve --help
 gufo serve llm --help
 ```
 
+For the optional AR4K service request policy, select the profile after `llm`
+and supply its companion limits explicitly:
+
+```sh
+gufo serve llm --model /models/model.gguf \
+  --request-policy ar4k-service-v1 --context 4096 --sessions 1 \
+  --max-pending 1 --max-pending-per-client 1 --max-tokens 256 \
+  --think off --preserve-thinking off
+```
+
+This profile admits framed autoregressive chat/response routes only. It
+refuses raw completions, speculative decoding, prompt lookup, explicit vision
+sidecars and disk cache. The input limit is 2304 tokens, counting rendered
+framing and tool definitions; the output limit is 256 tokens. Capacity is one
+active request plus one queued request; conflicts are refused explicitly. Cache
+bypass does not mean zero retention of in-memory state. The profile is a
+request-policy boundary, not a qualification of model lifetime or memory
+safety. Its complete HTTP header block, including the request line and final
+blank line, is limited to 16,384 bytes; larger headers receive HTTP 431.
+Omitting `--request-policy` keeps the existing server defaults.
+
 ### Diagnose
 
 Gufo can self detect if everything is correctly configured to be able to run, such as drivers, groups, permissions, etc.
